// E2E tests for warning hints (BT-4449): a compile warning carries its
// diagnostic hint as its own field through the REPL protocol
// (`warning_details`), on the standalone method-definition path
// (`compile_method`, merged with the class's recompile warnings). The inline
// class-definition path is covered by `class_side_protocol_types.btscript`.
//
// REPL-protocol cases share one workspace session, so every name here is
// prefixed `Bt4449`.

Object subclass: Bt4449Probe
  ping => 1
// => "Bt4449Probe"

Bt4449Probe >> probe => "abc" sizee
// => WARNING: does not understand 'sizee' HINT: Did you mean 'size'?
